Subject: [PATCH 11/20] References checked against Crossref and DataCite: wrong
 DOIs, wrong author lists, published versions

Corrections backed by the registry record (full audit in byu-vcl
docs/bo-hackathon-submission/reference-check.md):
- Wrong DOI: Szymanski 2023 (resolved to a yeast interactome paper),
  Aldeghi 2022 and Graff 2021 (did not resolve).
- Wrong author lists: Szymanski 2023, Aldeghi 2022, Johansen 2024,
  Leeman 2024, Judge 2024, Sabanza-Gil 2025, scikit-optimize.
- Preprints now published: Ansari and White (Digital Discovery 2024),
  Sabanza-Gil (Nat. Comput. Sci. 2025), Valentine (Soft Matter 2025),
  Rankovic (GOLLuM, now Nat. Mach. Intell. 2026); Adachi 2024 is AISTATS,
  not NeurIPS; Maus and GAUCHE years and pages.
- 27 missing DOIs added (Crossref title, author and year all matching).
- language = {en} becomes {english}, so the build no longer needs
  latexmk -f; one non-ASCII initial escaped so BibTeX does not split it.
